BT 1 0 0 1 0 88 Tm /F5+0 10 Tf 14 TL (This is a cooperative story-and-puzzle adventure you play with a child, or a few children, out) Tj T* (loud, with a printed kit and a few household bits. There is no app and no screen. You read a) Tj T* (little story, the children make choices, and together you solve gentle puzzles with simple dice.) Tj T* (You are all on the same side, helping each other through, never playing against one another. It) Tj T* (is a way to practise imagination, problem-solving, and working together, and a lovely excuse) Tj T* (for unhurried, screen-free time, which researchers link to how well children settle and thrive.) Tj T* (You need no experience at all. If you can read a bedtime story, you can run this.) Tj T* ET
