BT 1 0 0 1 0 60 Tm 14 TL .227451 .352941 .196078 rg /F5+0 10 Tf 14 TL (This is the heart of every kit: ) Tj /F6+0 10 Tf 14 TL (a failed roll is never a defeat, only a detour.) Tj /F5+0 10 Tf 14 TL ( If a dice roll) Tj T* (comes up short, do not stop the story. The players can spend an energy star and try again,) Tj T* (combine their strengths, accept a helpful nudge from a friendly creature, or simply find another) Tj T* (way round. Treat a miss as a funny surprise, not a failure. No child is ever knocked out, left) Tj T* (behind, or made to feel they have let the team down.) Tj T* ET
